  "answer": "The Strength note now has an app on its App side that walks you through the 4-week block one session at a time. I haven't run check_app or a preview, because I don't have those tools here, so it's untested.\n\n- **Layout:** it opens on your next unfinished session, with Prev and Next buttons and a jump list for all 12 sessions. Each lift shows its sets × reps @ kg, with one button per set to tick. Session and block progress show as a bar and a count, and you can clear a session's ticks.\n- **Where the data lives:** the full program, the 12 Oct start date and your ticks are all in the app's data. The note text is unchanged. Sessions are dated from 12 Oct, Monday, Wednesday and Friday.\n- **Weights:** week 2 is +2.5 kg on every lift and week 3 is +5 kg. Week 4 is 2×5 at the week 1 weights, including the deadlift (80 kg) and the row (35 kg), which I applied literally to every lift. If you wanted the deadlift to stay at 1×5 in the deload, say so and I'll change it.",
